From 9ad2c9b7d632b6d06660b696a30b45512701f68e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: MrBoogus <90836807+MrBoogus@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 12:18:24 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] driver: add PM3 command definitions, break-loop control,
 and Dbprintf log ring

- Add command opcodes in pm3_cmd.h for ISO14443A reader/sniffer/chkkeys/readsc,
  Mifare Classic, ISO15693, iClass, LF EM410x, HID Prox, T55xx read/write/snoop,
  antenna voltage sweep, and PM5 hardware control.
- Implement proxmark5_com_set_break_loop() sending 0x55 sync poll bytes to
  cleanly break continuous PM5 operations without desynchronizing the bus.
- Add an ANSI-stripped Dbprintf ring buffer to capture and surface PM5 firmware
  CMD_DEBUG_PRINT_STRING (0x0100) frames to UI pages.
- Add SPI bus activity tracking and busy state guards.
